11:19-11:20 error zero_based_array_index: SSL arrays are 1-based; index 0 is invalid. Use index 1 for the first element.
14:19-14:24 warning invalid_native_member: ':Count' on an array raises at run time: arrays have no Count property; use ALen() or :Length
